  "description": "Verifying a Salesforce deployment worked after the metadata landed: quick deploy from a validated ID, Apex test result interpretation, Deployment Status page drill-down, functional smoke testing, JUnit/coverage output for CI, and rollback strategies. NOT for polling a deploy that is still running or stuck Pending \u2014 use devops/deployment-monitoring. NOT for the gate-check before you click deploy \u2014 use devops/pre-deployment-checklist.",
  "file_location": "skills/devops/post-deployment-validation",
  "id": "devops/post-deployment-validation",
  "inputs": [
    "Deployment ID or validated deploy request ID from a checkOnly deployment",
    "Target org alias or credentials for the org being validated",
    "List of metadata components included in the deployment",
    "Expected functional behavior changes resulting from the deployment"
  ],
  "name": "post-deployment-validation",
